BT /F2 13 Tf 82.0 466.5 Td (4. Recommendations) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 82.0 447.5 Td (First, start at 0.01. In our runs it was the best single value, and it is a common default for plain) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 82.0 432.6 Td (stochastic gradient descent.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 82.0 409.6 Td (Second, if the loss goes up during the first epoch, divide the learning rate by ten and start again. Do) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 82.0 394.6 Td (not wait: a run that diverges early does not recover.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 82.0 371.7 Td (Third, if the loss falls steadily but slowly, multiply the learning rate by three. Stop increasing it as) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 82.0 356.7 Td (soon as the final loss gets worse, as it did here at 0.1.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 82.0 325.0 Td (5. Limitations) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 82.0 306.1 Td (These results come from one small network and one dataset. Larger models, other optimizers such as) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 82.0 291.1 Td (Adam, and learning rate schedules can all move the best value. The method of trying a few rates a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 82.0 276.2 Td (factor of ten apart carries over; the specific numbers do not.) Tj ET
